    narr:narration """This strata gathers a single working session on [installing humidity sensors across all four greenhouse bays before the first frost](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_1), with [the pilot unit assigned to bay two because it lost the most seedlings last winter](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_2) — a sequencing rationale one participant [ratified outright](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_3). A second thread holds that [sensors reporting every fifteen minutes are the floor, since anything slower misses the overnight drop](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_4). Two sub-narratives carry the frame forward: [sequencing installations against frost deadlines and past loss patterns](narr:Narrative_SensorDeploymentPrioritization), and [tuning reporting cadence to catch rapid overnight microclimate shifts](narr:Narrative_SensorReportingCadence).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_1> ;
